== label filters
fan                                left [wf equality assertion main]  log []
fan thenWT rec                     left [wf equality assertion main]  log [r@wf:W]
fan thenET rec                     left [wf equality assertion main]  log [r@equality:E]
fan thenPT rec                     left [wf equality assertion main]  log [r@assertion:P]
fan thenMT rec                     left [wf equality assertion main]  log [r@main:C]
fan thenAT rec                     left [wf equality assertion main]  log [r@wf:W; r@equality:E; r@assertion:P]
fan thenMLT [a]                    left [wf equality assertion main]  log [a@main:C]
fan thenMLT [a; b] (one main)      left [refused (thenMLT)]  log []
fan thenT ifWT rec                 left [wf equality assertion main]  log [r@wf:W]
fan thenT ifMT rec                 left [wf equality assertion main]  log [r@main:C]
== sequencing
seqOnMT [a; b]                     left [main]  log [a@:C; b@:C]
seqOnMT [fan; b]                   left [wf equality assertion main]  log [b@main:C]
seqOnMT []                         left [main]  log []
repeatMForT 0 fan                  left [main]  log []
repeatMForT 1 fan                  left [wf equality assertion main]  log []
repeatMForT 2 fan                  left [wf equality assertion wf equality assertion main]  log []
repeatMT (cut P on main once)      left [assertion main]  log []
failT orthenT rec                  left [main]  log [r@main:C]
rec orthenT failT                  left [main]  log [a@main:C]
fan orthenT rec                    left [wf equality assertion main]  log [r@wf:W; r@equality:E; r@assertion:P; r@main:C]
== assumptions
onSomeAssumT (succeeds at 2)       left [main]  log [try 1 on main; try 2 on main]
onSomeAssumT (succeeds nowhere)    left [refused (failT)]  log [try 1 on main; try 2 on main; try 3 on main]
onSomeAssumT, no assumptions       left [refused (onSomeAssumT)]  log []
onAllAssumT                        left [main]  log [at 1; at 2; at 3]
onAllMAssumT (each cuts)           left [assertion assertion assertion main]  log [at 1; at 2; at 3]
onSomeHypT on a goal that is no sequent left [refused (Term_man_ds.explode_sequent)]  log []
== argument tacticals
no arguments                       left [main]  log [with=none withs=none sel=none univ=none thin=true]
withT X                            left [main]  log [with=X withs=1 sel=none univ=none thin=true]
withT X (withT Y ...)              left [main]  log [with=Y withs=1 sel=none univ=none thin=true]
selT 2                             left [main]  log [with=none withs=none sel=2 univ=none thin=true]
withIntT sel 3                     left [main]  log [with=none withs=none sel=3 univ=none thin=true]
withT X, then on the subgoals      left [wf equality assertion main]  log [with=X withs=1 sel=none univ=none thin=true]
